@startuml Admin Dashboard

title Quy Trình Xem Dashboard Quản Trị

actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "Giao Diện\nDashboard" as DashboardUI
participant "AdminController" as AdminCtrl
database "Database" as DB
participant "Product Model" as ProductModel
participant "Category Model" as CategoryModel
participant "User Model" as UserModel
participant "Order Model" as OrderModel
participant "OrderDetail Model" as OrderDetailModel
participant "Chart.js" as ChartJS

== Xem Dashboard ==

Admin -> DashboardUI: Truy cập trang dashboard
activate DashboardUI

DashboardUI -> AdminCtrl: dashboard()
activate AdminCtrl

AdminCtrl -> ProductModel: count()
activate ProductModel
ProductModel -> DB: SELECT COUNT(*) FROM products
DB --> ProductModel: Số lượng sản phẩm
deactivate ProductModel

AdminCtrl -> CategoryModel: count()
activate CategoryModel
CategoryModel -> DB: SELECT COUNT(*) FROM categories
DB --> CategoryModel: Số lượng danh mục
deactivate CategoryModel

AdminCtrl -> UserModel: count()
activate UserModel
UserModel -> DB: SELECT COUNT(*) FROM users
DB --> UserModel: Số lượng người dùng
deactivate UserModel

AdminCtrl -> OrderModel: count()
activate OrderModel
OrderModel -> DB: SELECT COUNT(*) FROM orders
DB --> OrderModel: Số lượng đơn hàng
deactivate OrderModel

AdminCtrl -> OrderDetailModel: sum(cost * quantity)
activate OrderDetailModel
OrderDetailModel -> DB: SELECT SUM(cost * quantity) FROM order_details
DB --> OrderDetailModel: Tổng doanh thu
deactivate OrderDetailModel

AdminCtrl -> OrderDetailModel: getMonthlyRevenue()
activate OrderDetailModel
OrderDetailModel -> DB: SELECT DATE_FORMAT(created_at, '%m') as month,\nSUM(cost * quantity) as revenue\nFROM order_details\nGROUP BY month
DB --> OrderDetailModel: Doanh thu theo tháng
deactivate OrderDetailModel

AdminCtrl --> DashboardUI: Trả về view với dữ liệu thống kê
deactivate AdminCtrl

DashboardUI -> ChartJS: Khởi tạo biểu đồ doanh thu
activate ChartJS
ChartJS --> DashboardUI: Hiển thị biểu đồ
deactivate ChartJS

DashboardUI --> Admin: Hiển thị dashboard với số liệu thống kê
deactivate DashboardUI

@enduml
